adaptation = "The formula is evaluated in the source-supported fq=None mode so OHLC and VWAP remain in the same unadjusted price units. The signal uses information through the T-day close and is evaluated against the standard T+1 open return. Normalization audit: Balanced the source's unmatched parentheses; operator order and the one-day delta are unchanged."
